{"type":"Film","id":"FR2017_105","slug":"fr2017-105-grand-froid","title":{"native":"Grand Froid","english":"Back in Business"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-06-28","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Gérard Pautonnier","slug":"gerard-pautonnier","name":"Gérard Pautonnier","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/6/175/175878/format_page/grand-froid.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cPRwLV40LhI"},"synopsis":{"native":"Dans une petite ville perdue au milieu de nulle part, le commerce de pompes funèbres d’Edmond Zweck bat de l’aile. L’entreprise ne compte plus que deux employés: Georges, le bras droit de Zweck, et Eddy, un jeune homme encore novice dans le métier. Un beau matin, pourtant, un mort pointe son nez. L’espoir renaît. Georges et Eddy sont chargés de mener le défunt jusqu’à sa dernière demeure. Mais, à la recherche du cimetière qui s’avère introuvable, le convoi funéraire s’égare et le voyage tourne au fiasco.","english":"In a small town in the middle of nowhere, Edmond Zweck's funeral home is struggling to make ends meet. Zweck now only has two employees, his right-hand man, Georges, and young Eddy, who is new to the business. One fine morning, a dead body turns up at last, and their hope is renewed. Georges and Eddy are sent out to deliver the coffin to its final resting place. But they can't find the cemetery and get separated from the funeral procession, as the journey quickly turns into a fiasco."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"},{"country":"Poland","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2017_105_01","film":"FR2017_105","person":{"id":"Jean-Pierre Bacri","slug":"jean-pierre-bacri","name":"Jean-Pierre Bacri","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","n